 cycles:{programId:"refs:programs:one",name:"required",periodStart:"date",periodEnd:"date",dueDate:"date?",requirementIds:"refs:requirements",owner:"required",reviewer:"required",reportType:["periodic","independent","annual"],status:["draft","ready","under_review","reviewed","approved","published"],contentRevision:"integer",baselineId:"text",submissionRequirements:"list",decisions:"text"},
